Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.61,0:00:05.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't believe you would actually say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.61,0:00:05.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真不敢相信你会这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.65,0:00:08.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I would much rather be Mr. Peanut than Mr. Salty.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.65,0:00:08.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我宁可当花生先生 也不当盐先生
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.16,0:00:12.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No way. Mr. Salty is a sailor, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.16,0:00:12.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不会吧，盐先生是个水手哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.37,0:00:14.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's gotta be, like, the toughest snack there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.37,0:00:14.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他一定是最强悍的零食
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.54,0:00:19.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know. You don't wanna mess with corn nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.54,0:00:19.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}难说，不要惹到玉米坚果
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.54,0:00:22.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They're crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.54,0:00:22.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们是疯子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.30,0:00:26.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God. Oh, my God. You gotta come see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.30,0:00:26.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的天，我的天 你们快过来看
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.92,0:00:28.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's some creep out there with a telescope.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.92,0:00:28.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有一个恶心的人拿着望远镜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.80,0:00:34.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't believe it. He's looking right at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.80,0:00:34.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真不敢相信 他居然直接向我们这边看
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.31,0:00:36.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, that is so sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.31,0:00:36.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真是有病
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.77,0:00:38.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I feel violated.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.77,0:00:38.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有被强奸的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.68,0:00:40.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And not in a good way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.68,0:00:40.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且是不太好的那种
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.60,0:00:42.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How can people do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.60,0:00:42.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么有人能这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.98,0:00:47.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, you guys, look. Ugly Naked Guy got gravity boots.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.98,0:00:47.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们看，丑胖子买了一双倒立鞋
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.45,0:00:52.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Friends S01E20: The One with the Evil Orthodontist
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.45,0:00:52.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《老友记》 第一季 第20集：邪恶的矫正牙医
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.17,0:01:04.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（主演：詹妮弗·安妮斯顿）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.09,0:01:08.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（主演：柯特妮·考克斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.97,0:01:12.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（主演：丽莎·库卓）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.26,0:01:19.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（主演：马特·勒布朗）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.35,0:01:23.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（主演：马修·派瑞）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.86,0:01:27.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（主演：大卫·修蒙）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.41,0:01:40.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（中央咖啡厅）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.00,0:01:44.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm telling you, years from now, school children will study it...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.00,0:01:44.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我告诉你们 多年后，小学生都会把这个…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.83,0:01:47.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...as one of the greatest first dates of all time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.83,0:01:47.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当作史上最棒的第一次约会来研究
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.55,0:01:49.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.55,0:01:49.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}顺利到不可思议
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.05,0:01:53.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We could totally be ourselves. We didn't have to play any games.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.05,0:01:53.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们非常的自在 不需要耍心机
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.22,0:01:56.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- So have you called her yet? - Let her know I like her? Are you insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.22,0:01:56.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你打电话给她了吗  - 让她知道我喜欢她 你疯了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.89,0:01:57.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（制片：塔德·史帝文斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.47,0:01:58.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Guys. It's gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.47,0:01:58.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们男生真差劲
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.89,0:02:01.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's the next day. How needy do I wanna seem?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.89,0:02:01.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}才过一天而已 你要我看起来很黏人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.77,0:02:02.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（编剧：多提·阿布朗）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.48,0:02:03.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm right. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.48,0:02:03.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我说的对  对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.35,0:02:04.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Let her dangle. - Yeah, definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.35,0:02:04.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 吊她胃口 - 是，绝对的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.10,0:02:06.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.10,0:02:06.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.77,0:02:08.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't believe my parents are pressuring me...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.77,0:02:08.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真不敢相信我爸妈 给我压力…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.07,0:02:10.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to find one of you people.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.07,0:02:10.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要我找你们这种人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.36,0:02:13.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}God. Come on. Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.36,0:02:13.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊，直接打个电话吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.03,0:02:17.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Call her. Stop being so testosterone-y.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.03,0:02:17.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}打给她 别摆出一付臭男人的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.16,0:02:21.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Which, by the way, is the real San Francisco treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.16,0:02:21.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对了，旧金山真有这道菜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.83,0:02:23.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（导演：彼得邦纳兹）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.33,0:02:29.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I got her machine. - Her answering machine?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.33,0:02:29.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 是机器  - 她的答录机
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.55,0:02:31.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, interestingly enough, her leaf blower picked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.55,0:02:31.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 真有意思 是落叶机清扫机。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.47,0:02:37.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, um, why didn't you say anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.47,0:02:37.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你怎么不留话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.05,0:02:40.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, no, no, no. Last time I left a spontaneous message...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.05,0:02:40.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，不，不 上次我毫无准备就留言…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.14,0:02:43.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I ended up using the phrase, "Yes, indeed-io."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.14,0:02:43.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}结果讲出〝对，的确〞这种蠢话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.02,0:02:49.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MONICA: Look, it's Rachel and Barry. No, no, don't everybody look at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.02,0:02:49.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们看，是瑞秋和巴瑞 大家不要一起回头看
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.77,0:02:52.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Okay, okay. What's going on? - Okay, they're just talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.77,0:02:52.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 好啦好啦，是怎么回事  - 他们在讲话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.03,0:02:54.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, well, does he look upset?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.03,0:02:54.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她看起来有没有很生气
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.86,0:02:57.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Does he look like he was just told to shove anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.86,0:02:57.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他看起来是不是 被狠揍过一顿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.03,0:03:01.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. No, actually, he's smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.03,0:03:01.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有，他在微笑
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.95,0:03:04.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God. Don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.95,0:03:04.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊，不要那样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.41,0:03:05.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.41,0:03:05.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么了 怎么了 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.58,0:03:08.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That man across the street just kicked that pigeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.58,0:03:08.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对面有个男人踢了鸽子一脚
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.46,0:03:11.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.46,0:03:11.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.67,0:03:15.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And basically, that's how a bill becomes a law.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.67,0:03:15.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}基本上，提案就是这样成为法案的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.67,0:03:17.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}GROUP: Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.67,0:03:17.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.30,0:03:21.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- See? Hey, Rach. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.30,0:03:21.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 知道了吗  嘿 瑞秋  - 嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.93,0:03:23.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.93,0:03:23.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们还好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.60,0:03:27.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, it was, uh... It was actually really great.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.60,0:03:27.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}说真的，感觉还真好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.77,0:03:29.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Took me to lunch at the Russian Tea Room.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.77,0:03:29.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他带我去俄国茶坊吃午餐
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.73,0:03:33.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I had that chicken, you know, where you poke it and butter squirts out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.73,0:03:33.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我吃的鸡肉，一碰就有奶油流出来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.32,0:03:35.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not a good day for birds.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.32,0:03:35.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}鸟类今天很衰
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.57,0:03:37.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And then we took a walk to Bendel's.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.57,0:03:37.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后我们去逛百货公司
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.49,0:03:41.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I told him not to, but he got me a little bottle of Chanel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.49,0:03:41.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我叫他不要买 但他还是买给我一小瓶香奈儿香水
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.12,0:03:45.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's nice. Now was that before or after you told him...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.12,0:03:45.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很好，那是你在跟他说…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.04,0:03:50.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to stop calling, stop sending you flowers and to generally leave you alone, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.04,0:03:50.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别再打电话 送花  不要再烦你之前还是之后
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.96,0:03:54.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Right. Well, we never actually got to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.96,0:03:54.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗯，那个我们一直没提到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.96,0:03:58.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, it was just so nice to see him again, you know? It was...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.96,0:03:58.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再跟他出去 感觉真好 你们知道吗 感觉…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.26,0:04:01.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was comfortable and it was familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.26,0:04:01.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是很舒服 熟悉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.80,0:04:03.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was just nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.80,0:04:03.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}感觉真好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.51,0:04:06.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's "nice" twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.51,0:04:06.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}感觉真好两次了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.23,0:04:08.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Rachel, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.23,0:04:08.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋，这到底是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.64,0:04:11.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Isn't this the same Barry who you left at the altar?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.64,0:04:11.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他不是同样那个 被你逃婚的巴瑞吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.48,0:04:12.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Duh. Where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.48,0:04:12.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你都跑去哪里了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.94,0:04:16.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, but it was different with him today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.94,0:04:16.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊，可是他今天不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.03,0:04:19.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He wasn't, like, Orthodontist Guy, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.03,0:04:19.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他今天不是那个讨人厌的牙医
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.07,0:04:23.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, we had fun. Is there anything wrong with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.07,0:04:23.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们很愉快  这有什么不对吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.74,0:04:26.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.74,0:04:26.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.29,0:04:30.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Why? - I have my reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.29,0:04:30.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 为什么  - 我有我的理由
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.38,0:04:35.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, how about the fact that he's engaged to another woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.38,0:04:35.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他其实已经订婚了 而未婚妻刚好是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.38,0:04:37.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...who just happens to be your ex-best friend?
