Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.41,0:19:04.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mindy, of course, Mindy. It was always Mindy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.41,0:19:04.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}敏蒂，当然是敏蒂 一直都是敏蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.33,0:19:07.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Even when we were having sex in that chair?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.33,0:19:07.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}甚至包括我们 在那张椅子上做爱的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.04,0:19:11.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I swear, look, whatever I was doing, I was always thinking of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.04,0:19:11.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我发誓，不管我在做什么 心里想的都是你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.67,0:19:13.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.67,0:19:13.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.72,0:19:17.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}During that second time, you couldn't have picked her out of a lineup.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.72,0:19:17.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}第二次的时候，就算 排队等你挑，你都会认不出她来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.26,0:19:18.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You did it twice?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.26,0:19:18.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们还做了两次
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.68,0:19:21.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, the first time didn't really count. You know, it was Barry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.68,0:19:21.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}第一次不能算数 你也认识巴瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.22,0:19:23.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.22,0:19:23.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}噢，对哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.31,0:19:25.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Honey, baby, sweetheart, look...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.31,0:19:25.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}甜心，宝贝，亲爱的…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.14,0:19:28.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just give me another chance, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.14,0:19:28.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再给我一次机会，好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.23,0:19:31.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We'll start all over again. We'll go back to Aruba.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.23,0:19:31.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们再重新来过 我们回去阿鲁巴岛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.19,0:19:34.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What do you say?
