Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.61,0:19:37.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}BERNICE [OVER INTERCOM]: Dr. Farber, we've got an emergency here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.61,0:19:37.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}法柏医生，有点紧急状况 需要你处理
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.74,0:19:40.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Jason Castalano's choking on his retainer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.74,0:19:40.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}杰森卡斯达拉诺 被活动牙套呛到
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.53,0:19:43.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, God. Uh, I'll be right there, Bernice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.53,0:19:43.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊，我马上过去，柏妮丝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.58,0:19:45.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, please, please don't go anywhere, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.58,0:19:45.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的，请不要离开，好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.04,0:19:49.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I'll be right back. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.04,0:19:49.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我马上回来 - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.38,0:19:52.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, and we'll be here, hating you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.38,0:19:52.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，我们会留在这里 继续恨你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.59,0:19:56.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See how he was sweating when he walked out of here?
