Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.47,0:19:58.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If I'm hogging the ball, you jump right in there...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.47,0:19:58.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我抓他的下面 你就可以踢他…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.01,0:20:02.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and take a couple of punches. Because I'm telling you, this feels great.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.01,0:20:02.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后揍他两拳 我告诉你 那会感觉超爽
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.89,0:20:06.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I'm pretty sure I'm still gonna marry him.
